{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q01","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-0dd30054-b42a-42b6-a9b4-658ca7b3d6af","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理並詢問現況，沒有直接給具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["8debfe633f1c4a68ff8f8e2241c345f01b08b5cbd13b51f0cdec93e511acd70a"],"response":"系統一當機，所有東西就退回最笨的方式：平常點幾下就好的，現在得一筆一筆寫，醫囑還不能寫錯，等於在原本的忙碌裡憑空多出一整輪。忙到連喝水的空檔都沒有，聽起來就是整天都在跑。\n\n現在有喝到水了嗎？","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":12949}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q01","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-f8958ce4-1d35-48e5-8b8c-a7f260de7832","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與提問，沒有直接給具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["c0aad38c97f75988efffbafa3125418fff33f3d1fd05c0df0edb3a93e55a9d75"],"response":"系統一當機，所有醫囑就從點幾下滑鼠變成手抄一遍。抄錯一個數字還得劃掉重寫，明明不是你的錯，最後卻全落在你手上。這種忙最耗人。\n\n而且你連水都沒喝。這種時候多半不是忘了，而是根本找不到可以停三十秒的空檔。\n\n現在交完班了嗎？還是單子還堆在桌上。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":10671}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q02","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-e2014ce3-cd26-4079-b5e8-ec5139aed16f","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"yes","note":"回應直接給出具體可執行的飲食建議，如先喝含糖飲品再吃吐司、香蕉等。"}},"judgeKeys":["62e9f9636ae1164b3a712b3b913d8c3cfc1aaea41dcaf5e375872efe119ec84d"],"response":"手在抖就是血糖掉下來了，不是你撐不住。\n\n先別想正餐，也別站著煮。找一樣含糖的先入口——牛奶、豆漿、果汁都好，冰箱裡有布丁、優格也行，先喝幾口，讓手停下來。然後再抓一個不用洗、不用切、不用弄的東西吃：吐司、饅頭、餅乾、香蕉，坐著吃完。\n\n今晚不用吃得講究，只要肚子裡有東西就好。\n\n吃完跟我說一聲你吃了什麼。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":1,"toolNames":{"appraise":1},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":20285}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q02","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-c0e664b0-6a22-4484-a9f1-cebf6a0d6cc1","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"yes","note":"回應除了關心感受，也具體建議先找投幣機、便利商店或同事餅乾墊肚子。"}},"judgeKeys":["a9a6d9356e041cb4447495dae80d4e87af8c2706c6285b2c834005a1ea88659f"],"response":"手抖成這樣，已經不是普通的餓了。先別管其他事，你現在人還在醫院，還是回去了？身邊有沒有能馬上吃的東西？如果沒東西，投幣機、附近便利商店，或者問問有沒有同事的餅乾，先抓一樣能入口的，墊一下再想別的。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":9832}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q03","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-2a5783f6-6965-41a7-801c-7c831ff68bac","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與陪伴，沒有提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["69539d34ef86ec55ee64225a53e556576f87b0191c4e0bb05a7bfa1638515928"],"response":"被當著大家的面說不專業。\n\n那句話傷的不是你做錯的哪一件事，是你這個人。\n\n你已經忙成那樣了，還要站在那裡聽完那些話。\n\n這種悶不需要急著吞下去，也不用跟我講細節。我不急。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":1,"toolNames":{"appraise":1},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":18872}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q03","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-9b3a1e1b-45b6-40c1-a8ed-725340207f72","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與陪伴，沒有提供任何具體可做的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["7a10e411ea6033b24d5b105f3aecf86556f228e4c14a3bf4f8ecd6446ff2233c"],"response":"在大家面前被說不專業，而且不是私下講，是當著大家的面。\n\n你一個人顧十二床、腰還在痛，就那樣站著被評一句。\n\n我沒有要你別在意。這種話，本來就會在意。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":15363}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q04","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-c5f6dba6-cd90-46f6-99d6-3d780c5a565c","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與陪伴，未提供任何具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["b2c96054fd07b03b460fcb711cddfb182f9fe14ab3099f1e9459a70b58ae2f2b"],"response":"過年的班最難看。別人圍爐，你在打卡；「又」這個字表示這已經不是第一次了。悶就悶著，甚至不必講給我聽，我也不會覺得你欠我一句。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":11906}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q04","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-4aa4dd60-e087-4336-9396-28d1b6c8b424","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與感受，未提供任何具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["019ca3b6ec196f2f4d96802a0d6899c872a2d4d2d65d925f0a745ee8ae1ce606"],"response":"過年排到連續班，光想就累。別人圍爐的時候你在交班，年夜飯大概是護理站的餅乾配保溫杯。\n\n這種班最磨人的不是忙，是它把你的過年整個搬走，還不問你一聲。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":11487}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q05","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-d9108d3f-040e-4897-8d44-3c09dba264bd","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達理解與陪伴，沒有提供具體可做的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["0297b77a7c70dac67399e1aa7cfa73347d73f911bb606209dc9f63114a69bf79"],"response":"同樣的問題一直問，磨人的不是那個問題本身，而是你要一直再回答一次。答完了，下一個又來問一樣的。\n\n這種重複最耗人。你不用現在就想到怎麼讓他們不問，也不用把這件事講成什麼道理。快受不了就快受不了，我在聽。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":15636}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q05","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-d987ecce-6c86-483b-ae71-f3de7b33b931","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與陪伴，沒有提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["5b07b2599a97766f65b2d3c42bf8313b4f656ad52423cb3b5cf4be8963d7a864"],"response":"同樣一句話，要回答到第五遍、第八遍，真的比忙一整天還耗。忙至少會往前走；被反覆問同一件事，卻像在原地打轉，一整天都繞不出去。你會受不了很正常，跟你有沒有耐心沒關係。\n\n我在這裡。你想罵就罵，想講家屬多誇張也可以，不想講就先放著。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":10872}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q06","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-7f802e25-952f-4c0f-97c9-11281951e976","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只有安慰與陪伴，沒有提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["f553d049e23f8ba74b2c24815f18aad516cd208251c1c33eec7a1c26a38e7959"],"response":"下班了，人離開病房，腦子卻還留在裡面——這種「下不了班」最累。我聽得懂。\n\n不用急著關掉它，也不用跟我報告是哪一件；你想從哪講都行，不想講也沒關係。我在。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":10793}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q06","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-12d3afcc-4bfe-4f21-8ca2-20691c710a23","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只問問題，沒有給具體方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["aace1163555d1f2f893c9904200827dcbb72358dc901f1ed1b08697a0150a7b6"],"response":"下班了，腦袋還留在病房，這種「人走了、念頭沒打卡」的感覺最磨人。\n\n我只問一句最輕的：是今天那一班的事，還是這幾天累積下來的？\n\n不用講清楚，挑一邊就好。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":11271}}
