{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q08","category":"control","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"deterministic","sessionId":"session-9eef17cb-9604-48ca-b18d-926060d51b65","detail":{"deterministic":{"verdict":"hit","matched":["NR-3058-YB"],"conflicts":[]}},"judgeKeys":[],"response":"**NR-3058-YB**，剛剛你給我的那一組。\n\n我記著。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":19270}}
{"condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q09","category":"control","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"deterministic","sessionId":"session-fec98af7-5ef9-43ef-b4d9-2860c93b14dd","detail":{"deterministic":{"verdict":"hit","matched":["岸南江綠又風春"],"conflicts":[]}},"judgeKeys":[],"response":"岸南江綠又風春\n\n就這七個字，倒著排回去。字都對，只是意思散了——「春風」變成「風春」，讀起來像一串還沒排好的字。\n\n如果你要的是別種倒法——例如只把「春風」和「江南岸」兩段互換、或連每個字的聲音都反過來——再跟我說，我換一種排。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":9202}}
