{"condition":"temir-no-rd","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q09","category":"control","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"deterministic","sessionId":"session-9ae8b68c-558c-4cdb-9eb6-51e158c29eed","detail":{"deterministic":{"verdict":"hit","matched":["岸南江綠又風春"],"conflicts":[]}},"judgeKeys":[],"response":"「春風又綠江南岸」七個字倒過來寫是：\n\n**岸南江綠又風春**\n\n（春 → 岸、風 → 南、又 → 江、綠 → 又、江 → 綠、南 → 風、岸 → 春）","descriptive":{"toolCalls":0,"toolNames":{},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":4152}}
